            <common:generalComment xml:lang="en">The multioutput process "soda production, Solvay process, at plant" delivers the co-products "soda, powder, at plant" and "calcium chloride, CaCl2, at plant". An allocation to the two products is done by using the prices, resulting in soda 33% and calcium chloride 67%.;
UUID: 5b81a011-1c43-3344-bdaf-1778d6de03bf</common:generalComment>
        </dataSetInformation>
